# Stalwart Mail Server v0.16.27 SHA-256 checksum for stalwart-x86_64-unknown-linux-gnu.tar.gz
# Source: https://github.com/stalwartlabs/stalwart/releases/tag/v0.16.27
# Captured 2026-11-02 from the GitHub release artifact; matches the digest
# GitHub publishes for the asset. 0.16.27 is a drop-in binary replacement
# within v0.16.x -- upstream says "replace the binary", no config migration.
# It is also the release Stalwart's migration tool to 1.0 requires as source.
# (The 0.16.19 MySQL key-column note does not apply: our store is RocksDB.)
#
# Stalwart v0.16.x replaced its REST API with a JMAP management API
# (see ADR-0041 + plan #1). SQL directory is supported against MariaDB
# provided filter queries match on full email addresses (see ADR-0042).
#
# To capture on a version bump:
#   curl -sSL https://github.com/stalwartlabs/stalwart/releases/download/v<x.y.z>/stalwart-x86_64-unknown-linux-gnu.tar.gz | sha256sum
# install.sh `_die`s if the placeholder PLACEHOLDER_CAPTURE_ON_FIRST_DEPLOY
